graph TB
    Start[Agent Spawn Request] --> Hook1[Before-Spawn Hook Triggered]
    Hook1 --> Phase{Which Phase?}

    Phase -->|Phase 1 MVP| LoadFile[Load File-Based Memory<br/>Hive + SQLite]
    Phase -->|Phase 2+| LoadMulti[Load Multi-Backend Memory]

    LoadMulti --> LoadFile
    LoadMulti --> LoadQdrant[Load Qdrant Semantic Search]
    LoadMulti --> LoadCodeGraph[Load CodeGraph AST/Deps]
    LoadMulti --> LoadDocSections[Load Document Sections<br/>lines 100-120 of X]

    LoadFile --> Filter[Filter by Brand/Persona + Role]
    LoadQdrant --> Filter
    LoadCodeGraph --> Filter
    LoadDocSections --> Filter

    Filter --> InjectStrategy{Injection Strategy}
    InjectStrategy --> DirectInject[Direct Context Injection]
    InjectStrategy --> ToolAccess[Tool-Accessible Lookup]

    DirectInject --> Cache[Cache in Memory]
    ToolAccess --> Cache
    Cache --> Execute[Agent Executes Task]

    Execute --> AgentRequest{Agent Requests More Context?}
    AgentRequest -->|Yes| ToolLookup[Tool-Based Memory Lookup]
    ToolLookup --> BubbleUp{Needs Orchestrator Layer?}
    BubbleUp -->|Yes| EscalateContext[Bubble Up to Orchestrator]
    BubbleUp -->|No| Execute
    EscalateContext --> Execute
    AgentRequest -->|No| Complete

    Complete --> Decision{New Memories Created?}
    Decision -->|No| Cleanup[Agent Cleanup]
    Decision -->|Yes| Hook2[After-Task Hook Triggered]

    Hook2 --> ClassifyStatus[Classify Memory Status]
    ClassifyStatus --> ShortTerm{Short-Term or Long-Term?}

    ShortTerm -->|Short-Term| WriteShort[Write to Short-Term Memory<br/>status: in-progress]
    ShortTerm -->|Long-Term| WriteLong[Write to Long-Term Memory<br/>status: full-send]

    WriteShort --> Backend{Which Backend?}
    WriteLong --> Backend

    Backend --> FileWrite[File-Based: .pHive/memory/]
    Backend --> QdrantWrite[Qdrant Embedding Store]
    Backend --> CodeGraphWrite[CodeGraph SQLite Index]

    FileWrite --> CheckPR{PR Approved?}
    QdrantWrite --> CheckPR
    CodeGraphWrite --> CheckPR

    CheckPR -->|Yes, Phase 3+| PromoteHook[Post-PR Promotion Hook]
    CheckPR -->|No| Cleanup

    PromoteHook --> PromoteToLong[Promote Short-Term → Long-Term]
    PromoteToLong --> Cleanup

    Cleanup --> SandmanCheck{Sandman Scheduled?}
    SandmanCheck -->|Yes, Phase 5| SandmanCurate[Sandman Nightly Cleanup<br/>Archive/Delete Stale Memories]
    SandmanCheck -->|No| End
    SandmanCurate --> End[Agent Complete]

    style Start fill:#2a4a7c,stroke:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style End fill:#2a4a7c,stroke:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style Hook1 fill:#1a3a2a,stroke:#4a9e7f,color:#fff
    style Hook2 fill:#1a3a2a,stroke:#4a9e7f,color:#fff
    style Filter fill:#3a2a1a,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#fff
    style Execute fill:#2a1a3a,stroke:#a78bfa,color:#fff
    style PromoteHook fill:#1a3a2a,stroke:#4a9e7f,color:#fff
    style SandmanCurate fill:#3a1a2a,stroke:#ff6b9d,color:#fff
